cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this MCP server, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: Urban Growth MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server that measures how fast a city's built-up area grows year by year
  and what kind of land it replaces. It uses 10 m annual land cover maps
  (Esri / Impact Observatory 2017-2023 and ESA WorldCover) from the Microsoft
  Planetary Computer, and reports built-up area per year, the SDG 11.3.1 land
  consumption rate, land converted and map links.
